n    [#AF87FF]delivery[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]delivery: add a unified copy-delivery module that pairs Textual's OSC 52[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]write with the verifiable subprocess adapter (plus a tmux load-buffer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]candidate), reports a typed outcome, standardizes the success/failure [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]toast vocabulary, opens a selectable-text fallback modal when no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transport works, and sweeps every TUI copy call site onto the seam and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]off the message pump.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Representation targets and one copy-target registry[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]targets[dim] · [dim][/dim]after delivery[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]targets: collapse the duplicated copy-target label sets into one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry carrying footer labels, palette labels, categories, and plural [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]forms; add uniform Markdown-link and metadata-JSON targets to the four [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Artifacts key groups (link also to changespecs); make marked-set output [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]paste-ready per representation (newline-separated references, Markdown [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]list, JSON array, skip-and-report partial failures); and size-cap the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contents-shaped targets.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The Copy-as palette modal[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]palette[dim] · [dim][/dim]after targets[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]palette: make the copy prefix open a compact grouped palette modal built[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from the copy-target registry — configured keys as live accelerators, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warm-data previews, marked-set titles and plural rows, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot-after-dismiss, graceful unknown-key handling — reachable from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every tab, sub-tab, and forwarding modal, with footer/help/docs/PNG [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]File-kind representations in the artifact-files modal[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]files[dim] · [dim][/dim]after palette[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]files: give the artifact-files modal the same palette on the copy prefix[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with the full file-kind representation set — @file reference, Markdown [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]link, contents, stored path, source path (origin-labeled, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]missing-aware), and metadata JSON matching sase artifact show -j — for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single rows and marked sets, keeping y/Y as accelerators.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-az","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-az.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-6ea37dd9d906e45e60af3b2ed46ab0f8","started_at":"2026-07-29T23:13:34.495378+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"dd0c92f13497445175dd33ac33001b5c1fdbad51c57752f1eefb6fac96fa947e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/chat.md","size_bytes":2299},"commits":{"digest":"847ec5cf3e19723dcd28be9d54c194eb29dce7ec30a721eb926b3b03770fc2de","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-az.3--plan/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"6ae13ba9eb347e350672a4ce024b9095b315a6b64d301f432af67b5278e7b79d","path":"agents/b